{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Creepy Tale",
    "steam_appid": 1224020,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1224020/extras/58df0bf55449ed5c967ec16e7f3d89b0.avif?t=1751031296\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Creepy Tale is a mysterious puzzle-platformer crafted in a minimalist style, inspired by old, grim fairy tales where children found themselves in eerie places\u2014and only a few lucky ones ever made it back.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While walking with your brother, everything turns into horror and drags the hero into a series of terrible events. Your brother has been kidnapped, and you are left face-to-face with an ominous forest filled with dangers and strange creatures. Solve the puzzles that you meet on the way, do not let yourself be caught, and save your brother!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find out the dark story that befell the once-calm and peaceful forest, turning it into a creepy place filled with evil. Perhaps it is you who will be able to solve all the secrets of the forest and save the peaceful creatures?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1224020/extras/4f3aa3ae5a1f096712d7d52c0ca391a4.poster.avif?t=1751031296\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1224020/extras/4f3aa3ae5a1f096712d7d52c0ca391a4.webm?t=1751031296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1224020/extras/4f3aa3ae5a1f096712d7d52c0ca391a4.mp4?t=1751031296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1224020/extras/5739cc8eb9a2fabe581f3092de4ecf61.webp?t=1751031296\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A puzzle-platformer in the spirit of Limbo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features of a classic adventure: collect items for your inventory and use them in a variety of situations. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But this is not only a quest, you will have to hide, run away, jump high, and even ... learn to play the reedpipe!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A truly creepy soundtrack and beautiful 2D art will take you to a dark tale and give you few unforgettable hours!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1224020/extras/58df0bf55449ed5c967ec16e7f3d89b0.avif?t=1751031296\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Creepy Tale is a mysterious puzzle-platformer crafted in a minimalist style, inspired by old, grim fairy tales where children found themselves in eerie places\u2014and only a few lucky ones ever made it back.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While walking with your brother, everything turns into horror and drags the hero into a series of terrible events. Your brother has been kidnapped, and you are left face-to-face with an ominous forest filled with dangers and strange creatures. Solve the puzzles that you meet on the way, do not let yourself be caught, and save your brother!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find out the dark story that befell the once-calm and peaceful forest, turning it into a creepy place filled with evil. Perhaps it is you who will be able to solve all the secrets of the forest and save the peaceful creatures?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1224020/extras/4f3aa3ae5a1f096712d7d52c0ca391a4.poster.avif?t=1751031296\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1224020/extras/4f3aa3ae5a1f096712d7d52c0ca391a4.webm?t=1751031296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1224020/extras/4f3aa3ae5a1f096712d7d52c0ca391a4.mp4?t=1751031296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1224020/extras/5739cc8eb9a2fabe581f3092de4ecf61.webp?t=1751031296\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A puzzle-platformer in the spirit of Limbo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features of a classic adventure: collect items for your inventory and use them in a variety of situations. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But this is not only a quest, you will have to hide, run away, jump high, and even ... learn to play the reedpipe!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A truly creepy soundtrack and beautiful 2D art will take you to a dark tale and give you few unforgettable hours!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Creepy quest with the atmosphere of the Brothers Grimm fairy tales. Go through a dangerous adventure filled with puzzles and challenges! Perhaps it is you who will be able to solve all the secrets of forest and save the peaceful creatures?",
